      "date": "2026-04-19T13:04:53.000Z",
      "title": "ONGC: Future Cash Flows Will Balance Dividend Policy And Energy Partnership Execution",
      "body": "Analysts lifted their price target for the Oil and Natural Gas segment to ₹305.27 from ₹281.81, citing updated assumptions about higher revenue growth, slightly stronger profit margins, and a modestly lower future P/E multiple in their models. Analyst Commentary Recent Street research on related cyclical and capital intensive sectors points to an active debate that investors in Oil and Natural Gas should keep in mind.",
